// src/components/Wordmark.astro
// Normal mode's wordmark: a pixel "k" on a cartridge label, beside
// "krizdingus" set in Saira and converted to outlines, so no font loads for
// it. Inline, so it costs no request. Colours come from CSS: the shell and
// the word take the link's colour (currentColor), the label takes the
// section's --hue-fill and the "k" takes --on-fill. Every cartridge edge
// sits on a whole pixel at its drawn size (144 x 26). The artwork is
// decorative; the link around it carries the name.
---
